                    Hey-hey! Are you looking for a job as an English teacher online? We have an exciting offer for you.



We are an English language school for children and adults "AntiSchool". Due to the increase in the number of students, we are looking for Teachers to join our team.



Do you have similar work experience and want to try working in a foreign company? Fill out the form and our manager will contact you: hr.antischool.online/form-other-countries/





A little bit about us:

- we are a Ukrainian company and we have been working already for 6 years;

- we use our approaches to learning English;

- we have an interactive platform for our lessons;

- we are already presented in 3 countries and we don`t stop;

- 150 employees and 300 teachers work right now;

- we have more than 10,000 graduates and more than 1,500 students studying with us simultaneously.



A teacher at AntiSchool ONLINE is not at all like a traditional teacher, so our candidate:

- motivates students, loves to communicate, constantly develops in his profession, and most importantly, he wants how to help - people speak English, not just learn the rules;

- has excellent spoken English, experience of communicating and working with foreigners, practice abroad, likes the English-- - --- speaking environment (movies, music, shows, podcasts, articles) and meeting new people;

- interested in the development of a creative, non-standard and unique project.



What we can offer you:

- the opportunity to build your own working schedule - from 10 hours per week;

- fixed payment for each lesson and the opportunity to receive $800 per month.

- friendly team and support from the company at all stages of work;

- opportunity to develop as a teacher;

- work in a dynamic school that will soon become international.



Together with us that you will be able to realize your ambitions as a teacher in various ways.



If you have little experience in teaching, it's okay - we'll teach you everything. The main thing is your desire to work in the educational field and knowledge of the English language at a high communication level.



Register here : hr.antischool.online/form-other-countries/
